    "reason": "Markdown <-> Notion block conversion (CREATE_PAGE, APPEND_TO_PAGE, UPDATE_BLOCK, CREATE_DATABASE_ITEM content, GET_BLOCK_CHILDREN markdown), rich-text chunking at 2000 chars (ADD_COMMENT, titles), title extraction from typed property maps (SEARCH, LIST_DATABASES, GET_DATABASE), comment grouping and sorting by discussion (GET_PAGE_COMMENTS), computed success/firstMatch and title-bearing messages (FIND/ARCHIVE/RESTORE_DATABASE_ITEM), schema builders (CREATE_DATABASE, UPDATE_DATABASE_SCHEMA) and parent selection (MOVE_PAGE). All are code, not request/response shape."
  },
